  <text x="327" y="200" fill="#ffa500" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">3. Array Phase</text>
  <text x="327" y="218" fill="#ddaa66" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">Unitary sweeps</text>
  <text x="327" y="232" fill="#aa8844" font-family="monospace" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle">amplitude iteration</text>
